# golang.org/x/net/html DoS in the caddy binary shipped by caddy:2-alpine;
# Caddy doesn't parse untrusted HTML. Drop once the image bundles x/net >= 0.62.0.
CVE-2026-78661 exp:2027-01-31

# Go net/http panic when a handler reads a MaxBytesReader-limited body while
# writing the response header, in the caddy binary shipped by caddy:2-alpine
# (Go 1.27.3, fixed in 1.27.4). The Caddyfile only serves static files and sets
# no request body limit. Drop once the image is built with Go >= 1.27.4.
CVE-2026-97054 exp:2026-12-19
